/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (DevConf is a full-day, five-track event designed to inspire software developers across South Africa. It covers a range of topics with a focus on challenges unique to South Africa. With a decade-long history and hundreds of attendees returning each year, DevConf is the largest community-driven gathering for software developers in Southern Africa.)
