/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (DevConf is run in two cities, two days apart, reaching well over 1000 delegates each year. The conference attracts talented developers from diverse industries and organisations of varying sizes. Around 70% of attendees are in senior-level developer roles, bringing on average 12 years of professional experience to the event.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
